sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as App UI
    participant JWorker as JMAP Worker (Goroutine)
    participant Push as JMAP Push Monitor (Sub-Goroutine)
    participant Cache as LevelDB Cache
    participant Server as Servidor JMAP

    Push->>Server: GET /events (SSE stream abierto)
    Note over Push,Server: Conexión HTTP de larga duración

    Server-->>Push: data: StateChange{Email: "newState"}
    Push->>Cache: GetEmailState() → "oldState"
    Push->>Server: JMAP Batch Request
    Note right of Push: Email/changes(sinceState:"oldState")<br/>+ Email/get(#changes/created)<br/>+ Email/queryChanges(sinceQueryState)
    Server-->>Push: Batch Response
    Push->>Cache: PutEmailState("newState")
    Push->>Cache: PutEmail(id, metadata)
    Push->>UI: PostMessage(MessageInfo{nuevo correo})
    UI-->>UI: Inserta en lista en posición index
